  "body": "First slice of #1250: a reference page for the 2D milling and hole kinds.\n\nFork synced at v0.18.0 (cut from upstream/main 37482923).\n\n## What changed\n- New `site/content/guide/operations-2d.md` (weight 5): one section per kind with purpose and when to choose it over a neighbour, key settings by tab with the seeded defaults, geometry picks, and the common refusal messages.\n- `guide/operations.md` links to it; its Milling 2D row gains Trochoidal slot (a Mill2D kind on main that the table missed).\n- `posting.md` / `refusals.md` weights shift by one to keep the nav order.\n\n## Kinds covered, with sources\nThe kind list is `KindInfo::ALL` rows in `Section::Mill2D` / `Section::Drilling` (`crates/app/src/operation/kinds.rs`), Probe excluded.\n- Face, 2D Contour, 2D Pocket, 2D Adaptive, 2D Offset, Slot, Trochoidal slot, Trace, Engrave, 2D Chamfer, Circular, Thread, Drill, Bore.\n- Defaults: the seed fns in `kinds.rs` over the draft in `crates/app/src/operation/seed.rs`; `DEFAULT_OPTIMAL_LOAD` (`crates/motion/src/load.rs`), `DEFAULT_MAX_ENGAGEMENT` / `DEFAULT_MICROLIFT` (`crates/motion/src/machining2d/trochoid_slot.rs`).\n- Labels and tabs: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/{mill2d_page,mill2d_more_page,trochoid_page,holes_page,lead_page,fields}.rs`, `crates/ui/src/operations.rs`, `op_tabs.rs`.\n- Tool kinds: `crates/app/src/operation/tool_law.rs`.\n- Refusals: `crates/motion/src/machining2d/{face,contour,pocket,slots,chamfer,circular,bore,thread_mill,trochoid_slot}.rs`, `crates/motion/src/drilling/cycle.rs`, `crates/app/src/operation/{picks,tool_law,cross_part}.rs` and related.\n\n## How tested\nDocs only. `zola` is not installed on this machine, so `zola check` was not run; internal links use the `@/guide/...` form the sibling pages use.\n\n## Not in this slice (follow-ups for #1250)\n- 3D milling (3D Pocket, 3D Finish and its patterns, Deburr)\n- Multi-axis (5-Axis Contour/Parallel, Swarf, Adv. Swarf, Rotary Contour/Parallel/Offset, Multi-Axis Rough, 5-Axis Flow, Multi-Axis Contour)\n- Turning (Facing, Profile Rough/Finish, Groove Rough/Finish, Part, Threading, Chamfer, Taper, Multi-Pass, Form, Bore)\n- Probing\n- Plasma\n- Wire / sinker EDM (once they ship)\n- A toolpath picture per kind (the issue asks for one; none added here).\n\nEffort: high (docs slice)\n\nChangelog: none\n\nRefs #1250\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
